{"version":2,"width":100,"height":30,"timestamp":1788320426,"idle_time_limit":2.0,"command":"/Users/jinlei/.opencode/bin/opencode run --auto -m deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro '这篇论文（Abu-Ibrahim 等，PRC 77, 034607）在我们的知识库里是哪一篇？它引了谁，谁引了它？摘要里有什么可以直接核对的数字？'","title":"FUSION demo: one paper, offline corpus","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.921556, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n> build · deepseek-v4-pro\r\n\u001b[0m"]
[0.921569, "o", "\r\n"]
[3.916406, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mSkill \"kb-search\"\r\n"]
[26.359066, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mKB=/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki; ls $KB >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"KB OK\"; grep -rl 'authors:.*Abu-Ibrahim' $KB/papers | head -20\r\nKB OK\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0810.0320.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1107.0837.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0710.4193.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/nucl-th_0306066.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/nucl-th_0612029.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1005.0223.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1901.03875.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/nucl-th_0310026.md\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.45327, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mKB=/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki; grep -rl 'doi:.*10.1103/PhysRevC.77.034607' $KB/papers 2>/dev/null | head; grep -rli '034607' $KB/papers 2>/dev/null | head\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0710.4193.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/nucl-th_0605031.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0804.2459.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/2012.01549.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/2512.21453.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1507.08698.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1312.6792.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0710.4193.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1701.06305.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/1512.03150.md\r\n/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/nucl-th_0005047.md\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.759105, "o", "\u001b[0m→ \u001b[0mRead /Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki/papers/0710.4193.md\r\n"]
[37.481162, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mKB=/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki; echo \"=== CITES (in-corpus, from citations.tsv) ===\"; awk -F'\\t' '$1==\"0710.4193\"{print $2}' $KB/citations.tsv; echo; echo \"=== CITED BY (from citations.tsv) ===\"; awk -F'\\t' '$2==\"0710.4193\"{print $1}' $KB/citations.tsv\r\n=== CITES (in-corpus, from citations.tsv) ===\r\nnucl-th/0306066\r\nnucl-th/0605055\r\nnucl-th/0408071\r\nnucl-th/0612029\r\nnucl-th/9604033\r\nnucl-th/0601061\r\nnucl-th/0211025\r\nnucl-th/0410032\r\n\r\n=== CITED BY (from citations.tsv) ===\r\n1303.6720\r\n1005.0223\r\n1107.0837\r\n1202.2725\r\n2306.15178\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.228776, "o", "\u001b[0m$ \u001b[0mKB=/Users/jinlei/Desktop/code/FUSION/kb-wiki; echo \"=== relations: 0710.4193 as CITED (typed edges) ===\"; awk -F'\\t' '$2==\"0710.4193\"{print $1\"\\t\"$3\"\\t\"$5}' $KB/relations.tsv; echo; echo \"=== relations: 0710.4193 as CITING (typed edges) ===\"; awk -F'\\t' '$1==\"0710.4193\"{print $2\"\\t\"$3\"\\t\"$5}' $KB/relations.tsv\r\n=== relations: 0710.4193 as CITED (typed edges) ===\r\n\r\n=== relations: 0710.4193 as CITING (typed edges) ===\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.53637, "o", "**是哪一篇：** arXiv `0710.4193`（`kb-wiki/papers/0710.4193.md`），标题 *\"Reaction cross sections of carbon isotopes incident on a proton\"*，作者 Abu-Ibrahim, Horiuchi, Kohama, Suzuki。frontmatter 里 DOI 有两个：`10.1103/PhysRevC.77.034607`（即你问的这篇）和 `10.1103/PhysRevC.80.029903`（它的 Erratum）。\r\n\r\n**它引了谁（库内 8 条，citations.tsv 与页面一致）：**\r\n- nucl-th/0612029（2006，碳同位素反应截面系统分析）\r\n- nucl-th/0605055（2006，^22C 双中子晕）\r\n- nucl-th/0601061（2006，^16C 的 ^14C+n+n 模型）\r\n- nucl-th/0410032（2004，黑球近似）\r\n- nucl-th/0408071（2004，碳同位素形变）\r\n- nucl-th/0306066（2003，^6He 光学势 eikonal 近似）\r\n- nucl-th/0211025（2002，中子核物质表面分布）\r\n- nucl-th/9604033（1996，轻晕核物质半径）\r\n\r\n**谁引了它（库内 5 条）：** 2306.15178、1303.6720、1202.2725、1107.0837、1005.0223。`relations.tsv` 里它作为 cited 和 citing 均无 typed 边——"]
[51.536382, "o", "即这些全是普通参考文献引用，没有 `uses/compares/extends/contrasts` 的语义标注。\r\n\r\n**摘要里可直接核对的数字：** 摘要本身数字很少，只有三个：能量 **40 AMeV**（RIKEN 新测的 ^19,20,22C 数据）、同位素 **^19,20,22C**、以及 **N=6–16**。页面上 Key numbers 里的具体截面值（如 p+^12C@40MeV σR=432 mb、p+^22C@40MeV σR=957/1005 mb、R(C)=0.96±0.05 等）来自正文而非摘要，不能当\"摘要数字\"核对。\r\n\r\n注意：这些都是机器生成的 digest 与机械解析的引文边，引用关系要拿去和原论文 bibliography 核对才可当真。"]
[51.536429, "o", "\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[51.562773, "x", "0"]
